  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/103) by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nIn batch queue I have the possibility to use a template to name my exported files, using %p1/%f\\_art for example. This results in DSC\\_1000\\_art.tif. I would like to have this option standard in the Save dialog, like in Darktable $\\(FILE\\_FOLDER\\)/$\\(FILE\\_NAME\\)\\_dt. \n\nConvenience: easy to tell if a raw was processed with Darktable, Art of RawTherapee. For RT and Art I still have to name them manually by adding \\_art or \\_rt.\n",
